@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"
Feature: Patcher Builder and 74 u18 builds
  	Testing creation of 74 u18 builds on Patcher Builder.
  
  Setup:
  	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

  Scenario: Run fix pack builder hotfix 7x job
    @ignore = "true"
    As a TSE, I should be able to run the fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x, test-fixpack-builder-install and test-fixpack-builder-revert jobs

    Given I start the fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x job with the following parameters
      | fix.pack.baseCommittish          | 7.4.13-u18                               |
      | fix.pack.built.for               | INTUITIVE                                |
      | fix.pack.customer.ticket         | 12345                                    |
      | fix.pack.fixed.issues            | LPS-94011,LRPM18-1673                    |
      | fix.pack.hotfixed.issues         | LPS-94011,LRPM18-1673                    |
      | fix.pack.id                      | 1802                                     |
      | git.revision                     | 73b79946fd15659d4ddf129ab23dc88e3d986ab9 |
      | patcher.build.id                 | 236196111                                |
      | patcher.combined.branch          | true                                     |
      | patcher.fix.delivery.method      | Fix Pack 3.0                             |
      | patcher.request.key              | 8f9f8c77fdbeeb9e844c1de4916d1040de344bf4 |
      | patcher.security.patch           | false                                    |
      | patcher.user.id                  | 10196                                    |
    And I wait for "5" seconds
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    And I get the current build number for the job titled "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)"
    And I check the job with the name "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" for completion
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    When the job with the name "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" should have been successful
    Then I test the patching tool install and revert features with the following parameters
      | bundle                   | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/portal/7.4.13-u18/liferay-dxp-tomcat-7.4.13.u18-20220329081455288.tar.gz |
      | hotfix                   | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/hotfix/liferay-hotfix-1802-7413.zip                                      |
      | patchingTool             | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/fix-packs/patching-tool/patching-tool-LATEST-internal.zip                |
      | patchingToolMajorVersion | 3                                                                                                    |